        "created_at": "2018-04-29T22:01:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Actually, things that say \"multiple enemies\" in general.&nbsp; What defines multiple enemies?&nbsp; All enemies?&nbsp; Enemies in a group?&nbsp; This game could really do with a hex grid or more definition.</p>",
