        "id": 217849,
        "name": "speedyolrac",
        "username": "speedyolrac",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/{size}/1918_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-30T20:24:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This game is more loss on movement rules. I am sure the player guide will give some guidelines. If you want to make it crunchy by all means do so. Personally I have then can move with in the scene no problem. Give them a hard time if I think I need to.</p>\n<p>For what it can area attack target. I go of what they describe and how many makes “sense”.</p>\n<p>I play on a hex grid but keep everything loose. It is more of a drawing then a map. It is to save on people asking questions than evaluating distance.</p>\n<p>With a Tachyon doing her area attack the bots in scene 2 should not be an issue. Or you can have AS give a -4 hinder to all bots. that is a wombo combo.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
